+// CURLOPT_COOKIEFILE=nullptr (libcurl's own cookie engine off) — so page loads
+// sent NO Cookie header at all and threw every Set-Cookie away, while
+// document.cookie talked to a CookieJarDB nobody else touched: two stores, one of
+// which was permanently empty. Everything now goes through the session below.
+// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
